    <elementInformations>
        <elementInformation name="manufacturer" show="1">Teltonika Energy</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference" show="1">TeltoCharge 22 kW (EVC1200P4011 / EVC1201P4011 / EVC1210P1000 / EVC1210W1011 / EVC1211P1000 / EVC1211W1011)</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="designation" show="1">Teltonika TeltoCharge EV polnilnica 22 kW</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="description" show="1">polnilnica EV; komunikacija: Ethernet RJ45, Wi-Fi 2,4 GHz, Bluetooth LE, 4G/LTE (opcija, izvedbe EVCxx1x), RS-485 / Modbus (pametni števec za dinamično uravnavanje obremenitve): sponke A, B, GND, OCPP 1.6, RFID/NFC</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: TeltoCharge installation manual v2.3_G 2024 (s slovenskim dodatkom) str. PDF 8 (splošno), 9 (električno), 17 (priključki), 20 (vezava sponk); TeltoCharge datasheet GLOBAL 2 (2023-08) str. 1–3; Wiki: 22 kW TeltoCharge Electrical information str. -; Wiki: Dynamic Load Balancing + shema Eastron SDM72 (sponke GND/A/B) str. -</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="mass_kg" show="1">2.8</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="width" show="1">170</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="height" show="1">341</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="depth" show="1">94</elementInformation>
    </elementInformations>
    <informations>Viri: TeltoCharge installation manual v2.3_G 2024 (s slovenskim dodatkom) str. PDF 8 (splošno), 9 (električno), 17 (priključki), 20 (vezava sponk); TeltoCharge datasheet GLOBAL 2 (2023-08) str. 1–3; Wiki: 22 kW TeltoCharge Electrical information str. -; Wiki: Dynamic Load Balancing + shema Eastron SDM72 (sponke GND/A/B) str. -
Drawn with terminals2qet 0.2.0 from the terminal table</informations>
